<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fleet Financial Group.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fleet Financial Group.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan said it downgraded Fleet Financial Group to market performer from buy on price.</p>
<p>-- said expects Fleet to post lower-than-average earnings per share growth in 1998.  Said Fleet &quot;has more uncertainty regarding medium-term EPS growth prospects than the average bank.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Fleet lost 9/16 to 65-7/16.</p>
</text>
